  "title": "CogVis and SemDINO: Open-Vocabulary Change Detection Frameworks",
  "summary": "CogVis proposes a cognitive memory-guided framework for open-vocabulary change detection, while SemDINO introduces a foundation prior-guided approach for cross-temporal semantic reasoning. Both aim to improve performance in remote sensing change detection by addressing limitations in current methods.",
